## Test

```catala
declaration scope Foo:
  input y content integer
  context output x content integer

scope Foo:
  definition x equals 1000

  exception definition x under condition y = 0
  consequence equals 0

  label ex1
  exception definition x under condition y = 1
  consequence equals 1

  exception ex1 definition x under condition y = 2
  consequence equals 2

  label exx1
  exception definition x under condition y = 2
  consequence equals 102

  exception exx1 definition x under condition y = 3
  consequence equals 103

  exception exx1 definition x under condition y = 4
  consequence equals 104

declaration scope Test: foo scope Foo output x content integer
scope Test: definition foo.y equals 1 definition x equals foo.x
```

